# route: level=w6_l1 difficulty=beginner ends=exit after=tally expect=hurts:0,min_checkpoints:4,min_kills:8,letters:1
# The Beginner club route of Bubbling Fen (designer D6; recorded from build/d6/bot_w6_l1.gd). Wades the first tar
# field and hops out, climbs out of the tar pit on its vine, walks off the raised bank onto the raft, paddles it into
# the current and, past it, with forward strikes facing back to the far bank; under the root deck; three head
# bounces tame Chomper from the stump; rides him over the tar flats (stops and bites each slime and frog as it
# comes, hops onto the island and the stump for letter R); off at checkpoint 3, the water bucket, the gnat thicket
# and the exit totem. Never presses S and never takes the hammer (belt invariance).
